aubio 0.4.9 (https://aubio.org, git tag 0.4.9, commit 90bd27a2), GPL-3.0-or-later,
see COPYING and AUTHORS. Only the parts BeatFork's tempo detection and tuner need are kept:
src/*.c core, spectral, tempo, onset, temporal, utils and pitch (pitch added for the
tuner in 1.8.0, same tag). Not included: io (sndfile, avcodec and similar sources),
notes, synth, effects. src/config.h is written
for this build (no fftw, bundled ooura FFT). Compiled into the app by aubio.pri.
